# Input

```vue
<template>
  <foo-bar
    @click="[foo, bar].forEach(fn => void fn())"
    @loaded="(map = $event) && initMap()"
  ></foo-bar>
</template>

```


# Prettier differences

```diff
--- Prettier
+++ Biome
@@ -1,6 +1,6 @@
 <template>
   <foo-bar
-    @click="[foo, bar].forEach(fn => void fn())"
+    @click="[foo, bar].forEach((fn) => void fn())"
     @loaded="(map = $event) && initMap()"
   ></foo-bar>
 </template>
```

# Output

```vue
<template>
  <foo-bar
    @click="[foo, bar].forEach((fn) => void fn())"
    @loaded="(map = $event) && initMap()"
  ></foo-bar>
</template>
```
